+- `SPEC-VACUITY.false-result`: `WarnStuckClaimState`; residual heap contains
+  `list(vCons(I, .ValSeq))` while the mutation demands `list(.ValSeq)`.
+- `SPEC-BODY-MUTATION.removed-append`: `WarnStuckClaimState`; residual heap
